stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Future : POST compensation-plans with a later start date
    [*] --> Current : POST compensation-plans from today, employee create or salary update
    Future --> Current : clinic date reaches effective_from
    Current --> Closed : newer version added - effective_to set to the day before
    Future --> Replaced : new version with the same start day, no charge used it
    Current --> Replaced : new version with the same start day, no charge used it
    Replaced --> [*] : row deleted
    Closed --> [*]
